  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Protects Your Workspace During Precision Cutting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cutting directly on a desk can damage the work surface and dull blades quickly, especially during repeated trimming and model work. This self-healing cutting mat provides a dedicated surface for precise cutting tasks, helping protect your workspace while supporting cleaner, more controlled cuts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Built-In Measuring Guides for Bench Work"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The mat features a wide range of printed measuring guides, including edge rulers, grid lines, angle markings, circle references, arc guides, and fine-detail grids. These built-in references make it easier to measure materials, align parts, and plan cuts more accurately during maker tasks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Two Sizes for Different Workspaces"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Available in A3 and A4 sizes, the cutting mat fits different bench setups and working styles. A3 offers more room for larger projects, while A4 provides a compact option for smaller desks."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Protects Your Workspace During Precision Cutting</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Cutting directly on a desk can damage the work surface and dull blades quickly, especially during repeated trimming and model work. This self-healing cutting mat provides a dedicated surface for precise cutting tasks, helping protect your workspace while supporting cleaner, more controlled cuts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/1e12bc8eb84e424681c40368a6aaae94/1.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/1e12bc8eb84e424681c40368a6aaae94/1.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 卖点 2 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Built-In Measuring Guides for Bench Work</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The mat features a wide range of printed measuring guides, including edge rulers, grid lines, angle markings, circle references, arc guides, and fine-detail grids. These built-in references make it easier to measure materials, align parts, and plan cuts more accurately during maker tasks.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/86089fe216b24ca897098455131f9ac1/2.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/86089fe216b24ca897098455131f9ac1/2.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 卖点 3 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\">Two Sizes for Different Workspaces</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Available in A3 and A4 sizes, the cutting mat fits different bench setups and working styles. A3 offers more room for larger projects, while A4 provides a compact option for smaller desks.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f731e06bec3c474aa2ef15fd7e83136c/A3_Durable_Cutting_Mat.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/dca1ac6a51cd4091b8932e285d755b1b/A4_Durable_Cutting_Mat.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
